  description: A group of reddish stains forming a spatter pattern on a floor surface.
  foundLocation: On the kitchen floor near the body.
  observedCondition: Multiple droplets were visible with differing shapes, sizes
    and directions. The pattern was documented before sampling.
  investigativeContext: The distribution of droplets can help reconstruct what happened
    near John's position and identify the likely attack area. Pattern interpretation
    does not identify a person by itself.
  loggingContext: 
